%% Platform-admin organization and tenant provisioning sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Operator as Platform admin
    participant Web as Platform admin web
    participant API as Platform API
    participant Org as OrganizationsService
    participant Platform as Control-plane PostgreSQL
    participant Run as ProvisioningService
    participant Domain as DomainsService
    participant Provisioner as Tenant DB provisioner
    participant Bootstrap as Schema bootstrapper
    participant Audit as Platform audit

    Operator->>Web: Submit organization name, slug, owner email
    Web->>API: POST /platform/organizations
    API->>Org: Validate and normalize input
    Org->>Platform: Create PROVISIONING organization
    Org->>Platform: Create initial owner membership
    Org->>Audit: Record organization-created event
    Org-->>API: Organization metadata
    API-->>Web: Organization metadata

    Operator->>Web: Start provisioning with idempotency key
    Web->>API: POST /organizations/:id/provision
    API->>Run: Start or resume ProvisioningRun

    loop Ordered provisioning steps
        Run->>Domain: RESERVE_SUBDOMAIN
        Run->>Platform: REGISTER_TENANT_DATABASE
        Run->>Provisioner: PROVISION_PHYSICAL_DATABASE
        Provisioner-->>Run: Encrypted registry material
        Run->>Bootstrap: APPLY_MIGRATIONS
        Run->>Bootstrap: SEED_TENANT
        Run->>Platform: ATTACH_OWNER_MEMBERSHIP evidence
        Run->>Bootstrap: HEALTH_CHECK
        Run->>Bootstrap: SMOKE_TEST / verifyReady
        Run->>Domain: ACTIVATE_ORGANIZATION and platform domain
        Run->>Platform: Record step outcome
    end

    alt All steps succeed
        Run->>Platform: Transition organization to ACTIVE
        Run->>Audit: Record activation event
        Platform-->>Web: ACTIVE and READY result
    else Step fails
        Run->>Platform: Mark run FAILED and org PROVISIONING_FAILED
        Run->>Audit: Record failed step and sanitized error
        Platform-->>Web: Retryable failure and run timeline
    end
